cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Page2AI Benchmark: reproducible web-to-Markdown extraction comparison"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible benchmark that compares Page2AI, Firecrawl v2,
  and Jina Reader on documentation frameworks (Mintlify, Docusaurus,
  Starlight, Nextra, Fumadocs). Includes automatic scorers for chars,
  headings, code blocks, tables, and empty-alt image ratio. Framed as an
  exploratory case study, not a statistical benchmark.
type: software
